  ],
  "duration_s": 530.622993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国历史上最有文人气的名楼都有哪些吗？上集，咱们聊了甲绣楼、望江楼、太白楼、大观楼、鹳雀楼这集直接揭开谜底，看看前五名文气身后到了什么程度，尤其是排在榜首的那座楼，全国老少全知道，但给他注入灵魂的那位老祖宗一辈子，连他的楼梯都没踩过一步。他隔着几百里地，就凭手头一张图纸一封老朋友的信，就让这座楼成了全天下读书人做人做官的一盏明灯。老规矩，开讲之前，劳烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁。在听第五名，天星阁、湖南长沙到了前五名历史的沉重感就压上来了。它是长沙老城墙上无唯一剩下来的制高点，就坐在老城东南角的高土坡上，青砖大墙垒的老高三层阁楼，像大鸟展翅一样立在风里。早些年间，这里就是湖南读书人聚在一起谈论天下大事的地方。名字的意思就是人心顺应天理，是湖南人讲究真刀真枪干实事的根据地。结果到了一九三八年，那场惨烈的大火，整座长沙老城几乎全给烧平了，天心阁也没躲过去，雕花大梁一眨眼全成了灰，但湖南的老少爷们儿硬是没认输。咬着牙在烧焦的明代老城墙石基上，一次次又把它重新立了起来，城被炸破了楼被烧塌了，但文人手里的骨气一直牢牢钉在城头上，您说这是不是最硬气的一抹文人骨气？第四名，蓬莱阁，山东烟台。如果说别的名楼讲的是在朝廷里做大官，那这座讲的就是文人骨子里想要放飞的浪漫与洒脱。他直接趴在黄海边上的大悬崖，顶上楼阁拔地而起，脚底下全是悬崖峭壁，海风一吹，白雾茫茫，远远看着就跟飘在海水里一样。这里历来是老百姓讲八仙过海的地方。当年大文豪苏东坡到这里，做官，在海市蜃楼前头看呆了，写下了长长的名诗。几百年来，不知多少失意的文人跑到这儿面朝大海，放声大喊，在石壁上刻满了字。可文，人们大老远跑来，不是真为了上天当神仙，而是把官场里的窝囊气心里的憋屈，通通借着狂风巨浪倒进大海里，在神仙住的地方，安放人间的失落。您说这算不算最洒脱的文人？妻第三名，黄鹤楼，湖北武汉，这是全中国名气最大的楼之一。但他真正厉害的地方是，这里成了历代顶尖高手互不服气的一座斗石场。主楼五十多米，高五层，飞檐金碧辉煌，傲生生立在蛇山顶上眼皮子底下就是滚滚长江。一千多年里，文人在上面留下的诗有一千四百多首。当年唐朝诗人崔颢爬上楼，一口气写下黄鹤一去不复返，白云千载空悠悠。狂的没边的李白兴冲冲跑过来读完这首诗。站在原地半天，没说出话，最后叹了口气，把毛笔往桌上一撂，留下两句话。眼前有景到不得，崔颢题诗在上头硬是没敢接着写。直到好多年后，李白还是咽不下这口气，又补写了名句来回敬一座楼，能让全天下最傲气的天才在同一堵墙上较劲。一千多年。除了黄鹤楼，天底下再找不出第二座，这是什么样的文气与傲气？第二名，滕王阁，江西南昌讲到第二名，他已经几乎把读书人的才气堆到了顶峰。五十七米高九层，飞檐气派大的很。微微立在赣江边上，公元六百七十五年，九月初九重阳节，严都督在阁子里，大摆酒席请客。本来想让自己女婿出风头，二十出头的穷小子王勃路过这儿，提笔写下了滕王阁序。落霞与孤鹜齐飞，秋水共长天一色，字字漂亮的吓勃现场，那些当官的和有钱人全看傻了眼。可真正让人人心疼的是，这藤王阁命运太坎坷了。在战火里，前前后后被烧塌了二十八次后人硬是咬牙重建了二十九次王勃。当年喝酒的那座木头老楼，连一粒木头沫子都没能留到今天。可哪怕现实里的楼塌了二十八回，连一有读书人心里那座金碧辉煌的滕王阁永远高高挂在天边，楼塌了二十八次，才华却赢了一千四百年。这就是滕王阁不可替代的遗纯。第一名，岳阳楼，湖南岳阳为什么是他黄鹤楼？有无数的好诗，滕王阁有绝顶的文章，可只有岳阳楼让一座冰冷的建筑彻底变成了全中国人的精神脊梁。他就立在洞庭湖边上，全是木头搭起来的三层楼，四根通天大柱顶上像扣了个大将军头盔，从头到尾每使一根铁钉。公元一零四四年滕子京重修岳阳楼，给远在河南老家养病的好哥们儿，范仲淹寄了一幅画。这时候，范仲淹刚革新失败，被朝廷贬了。官一身是病，他这辈子压根就没去过岳阳楼，也没踩过一级楼梯。可他把画纸铺在桌上，提笔写下的不是自己的委屈，不是官场上的窝囊，也不是湖边的美景，而是砸在历史骨缝里的十个大字。先天下之忧而忧，后天下之乐而乐。一座楼打这天起，不再只是个看风景的亭台楼阁，他成了中国读书人一辈子做人做事的最高标尺。别的楼楼比的是词句有多漂亮，花样有多好看。而岳阳楼比的是文人胸怀天下，苍生的骨头到底有多硬？十座名楼讲完了太秀楼，点亮了贵州的文脉。望江楼藏着才女的烈泪，太白楼倒满了诗仙的烈酒。太观楼看透了百年的历史。鹳雀楼二十个字，穿透黄河天金阁，在大火焦土里立起硬骨头蓬莱阁，把人间心事丢给了大海。黄鹤楼让千百个文豪把笔较劲滕王阁，哪怕踏了二十八回，依然才气无双可唯独岳阳楼。写他的人，一辈子没踏进一步，却用一肚子的胸襟重新立起了读书人的灵魂。您说什么叫真正的文人气？最顶级的文人气从来不是楼修的，有多高有多大，也不是词句堆的有多华丽，而是即便自己被踩在泥坑里，心里头想的依然是天下老百姓能不能过上好日子？最后问您一句，这十座名楼您去过哪几座？您心里最有文人气的是哪一座？想听更多名胜古迹背后的故事，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00001",
      "start_ms": 270,
      "end_ms": 4530,
      "text": "您知道中国历史上最有文人气的名楼都有哪些吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4810,
      "end_ms": 5370,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5390,
      "end_ms": 13150,
      "text": "咱们聊了甲绣楼、望江楼、太白楼、大观楼、鹳雀楼这集直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00004",
      "start_ms": 13810,
      "end_ms": 16910,
      "text": "看看前五名文气身后到了什么程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00005",
      "start_ms": 17270,
      "end_ms": 20030,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那座楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00006",
      "start_ms": 20770,
      "end_ms": 22670,
      "text": "全国老少全知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00007",
      "start_ms": 22930,
      "end_ms": 27210,
      "text": "但给他注入灵魂的那位老祖宗一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00008",
      "start_ms": 27390,
      "end_ms": 30300,
      "text": "连他的楼梯都没踩过一步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00009",
      "start_ms": 30620,
      "end_ms": 32140,
      "text": "他隔着几百里地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00010",
      "start_ms": 32320,
      "end_ms": 35980,
      "text": "就凭手头一张图纸一封老朋友的信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00011",
      "start_ms": 36500,
      "end_ms": 41780,
      "text": "就让这座楼成了全天下读书人做人做官的一盏明灯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00012",
      "start_ms": 42240,
      "end_ms": 42920,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00013",
      "start_ms": 43180,
      "end_ms": 44040,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00014",
      "start_ms": 44060,
      "end_ms": 46139,
      "text": "劳烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00015",
      "start_ms": 46500,
      "end_ms": 47760,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00016",
      "start_ms": 47760,
      "end_ms": 49200,
      "text": "在听第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00017",
      "start_ms": 49680,
      "end_ms": 57640,
      "text": "天星阁、湖南长沙到了前五名历史的沉重感就压上来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00018",
      "start_ms": 57940,
      "end_ms": 61845,
      "text": "它是长沙老城墙上无唯一剩下来的制高点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00019",
      "start_ms": 62660,
      "end_ms": 65555,
      "text": "就坐在老城东南角的高土坡上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00020",
      "start_ms": 66360,
      "end_ms": 69600,
      "text": "青砖大墙垒的老高三层阁楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00021",
      "start_ms": 69600,
      "end_ms": 71945,
      "text": "像大鸟展翅一样立在风里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00022",
      "start_ms": 72360,
      "end_ms": 73275,
      "text": "早些年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00023",
      "start_ms": 73810,
      "end_ms": 78325,
      "text": "这里就是湖南读书人聚在一起谈论天下大事的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00024",
      "start_ms": 79000,
      "end_ms": 81905,
      "text": "名字的意思就是人心顺应天理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00025",
      "start_ms": 82480,
      "end_ms": 86505,
      "text": "是湖南人讲究真刀真枪干实事的根据地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00026",
      "start_ms": 86950,
      "end_ms": 88490,
      "text": "结果到了一九三八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00027",
      "start_ms": 88490,
      "end_ms": 90005,
      "text": "那场惨烈的大火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00028",
      "start_ms": 90680,
      "end_ms": 93815,
      "text": "整座长沙老城几乎全给烧平了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00029",
      "start_ms": 94380,
      "end_ms": 95995,
      "text": "天心阁也没躲过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00030",
      "start_ms": 96620,
      "end_ms": 99045,
      "text": "雕花大梁一眨眼全成了灰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00031",
      "start_ms": 99450,
      "end_ms": 102635,
      "text": "但湖南的老少爷们儿硬是没认输。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00032",
      "start_ms": 103370,
      "end_ms": 107475,
      "text": "咬着牙在烧焦的明代老城墙石基上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00033",
      "start_ms": 107880,
      "end_ms": 110265,
      "text": "一次次又把它重新立了起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00034",
      "start_ms": 110790,
      "end_ms": 113485,
      "text": "城被炸破了楼被烧塌了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00035",
      "start_ms": 113910,
      "end_ms": 118065,
      "text": "但文人手里的骨气一直牢牢钉在城头上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00036",
      "start_ms": 118480,
      "end_ms": 121525,
      "text": "您说这是不是最硬气的一抹文人骨气？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00037",
      "start_ms": 122010,
      "end_ms": 122735,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00038",
      "start_ms": 123110,
      "end_ms": 123730,
      "text": "蓬莱阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00039",
      "start_ms": 124030,
      "end_ms": 125095,
      "text": "山东烟台。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00040",
      "start_ms": 125710,
      "end_ms": 128875,
      "text": "如果说别的名楼讲的是在朝廷里做大官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00041",
      "start_ms": 129480,
      "end_ms": 135085,
      "text": "那这座讲的就是文人骨子里想要放飞的浪漫与洒脱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00042",
      "start_ms": 135500,
      "end_ms": 138720,
      "text": "他直接趴在黄海边上的大悬崖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00043",
      "start_ms": 138720,
      "end_ms": 141495,
      "text": "顶上楼阁拔地而起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00044",
      "start_ms": 142040,
      "end_ms": 144135,
      "text": "脚底下全是悬崖峭壁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00045",
      "start_ms": 144570,
      "end_ms": 145430,
      "text": "海风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00046",
      "start_ms": 145450,
      "end_ms": 146345,
      "text": "白雾茫茫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00047",
      "start_ms": 146730,
      "end_ms": 149315,
      "text": "远远看着就跟飘在海水里一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00048",
      "start_ms": 149970,
      "end_ms": 153405,
      "text": "这里历来是老百姓讲八仙过海的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00049",
      "start_ms": 153780,
      "end_ms": 156120,
      "text": "当年大文豪苏东坡到这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00050",
      "start_ms": 156120,
      "end_ms": 156520,
      "text": "做官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00051",
      "start_ms": 156880,
      "end_ms": 159435,
      "text": "在海市蜃楼前头看呆了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00052",
      "start_ms": 159920,
      "end_ms": 161805,
      "text": "写下了长长的名诗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00053",
      "start_ms": 162420,
      "end_ms": 163180,
      "text": "几百年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00054",
      "start_ms": 163180,
      "end_ms": 167050,
      "text": "不知多少失意的文人跑到这儿面朝大海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00055",
      "start_ms": 167130,
      "end_ms": 168145,
      "text": "放声大喊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00056",
      "start_ms": 168550,
      "end_ms": 170355,
      "text": "在石壁上刻满了字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00057",
      "start_ms": 170780,
      "end_ms": 171240,
      "text": "可文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00058",
      "start_ms": 171280,
      "end_ms": 172975,
      "text": "人们大老远跑来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00059",
      "start_ms": 173630,
      "end_ms": 176115,
      "text": "不是真为了上天当神仙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00060",
      "start_ms": 176740,
      "end_ms": 181245,
      "text": "而是把官场里的窝囊气心里的憋屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00061",
      "start_ms": 181790,
      "end_ms": 185055,
      "text": "通通借着狂风巨浪倒进大海里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00062",
      "start_ms": 185520,
      "end_ms": 187340,
      "text": "在神仙住的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00063",
      "start_ms": 187400,
      "end_ms": 189125,
      "text": "安放人间的失落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00064",
      "start_ms": 189670,
      "end_ms": 192250,
      "text": "您说这算不算最洒脱的文人？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00065",
      "start_ms": 192250,
      "end_ms": 193835,
      "text": "妻第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00066",
      "start_ms": 194300,
      "end_ms": 195245,
      "text": "黄鹤楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00067",
      "start_ms": 195690,
      "end_ms": 196615,
      "text": "湖北武汉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00068",
      "start_ms": 197360,
      "end_ms": 200215,
      "text": "这是全中国名气最大的楼之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00069",
      "start_ms": 200850,
      "end_ms": 203220,
      "text": "但他真正厉害的地方是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00070",
      "start_ms": 203220,
      "end_ms": 208305,
      "text": "这里成了历代顶尖高手互不服气的一座斗石场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00071",
      "start_ms": 208730,
      "end_ms": 209930,
      "text": "主楼五十多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00072",
      "start_ms": 209930,
      "end_ms": 211210,
      "text": "高五层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00073",
      "start_ms": 211270,
      "end_ms": 213395,
      "text": "飞檐金碧辉煌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00074",
      "start_ms": 213820,
      "end_ms": 219255,
      "text": "傲生生立在蛇山顶上眼皮子底下就是滚滚长江。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00075",
      "start_ms": 219830,
      "end_ms": 221045,
      "text": "一千多年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00076",
      "start_ms": 221520,
      "end_ms": 225265,
      "text": "文人在上面留下的诗有一千四百多首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00077",
      "start_ms": 225700,
      "end_ms": 228505,
      "text": "当年唐朝诗人崔颢爬上楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00078",
      "start_ms": 228870,
      "end_ms": 231535,
      "text": "一口气写下黄鹤一去不复返，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00079",
      "start_ms": 231920,
      "end_ms": 233555,
      "text": "白云千载空悠悠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00080",
      "start_ms": 234360,
      "end_ms": 238885,
      "text": "狂的没边的李白兴冲冲跑过来读完这首诗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00081",
      "start_ms": 239230,
      "end_ms": 240820,
      "text": "站在原地半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00082",
      "start_ms": 240820,
      "end_ms": 241705,
      "text": "没说出话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00083",
      "start_ms": 242170,
      "end_ms": 243325,
      "text": "最后叹了口气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00084",
      "start_ms": 243740,
      "end_ms": 245245,
      "text": "把毛笔往桌上一撂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00085",
      "start_ms": 245670,
      "end_ms": 246685,
      "text": "留下两句话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00086",
      "start_ms": 247490,
      "end_ms": 249645,
      "text": "眼前有景到不得，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00087",
      "start_ms": 250120,
      "end_ms": 253895,
      "text": "崔颢题诗在上头硬是没敢接着写。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00088",
      "start_ms": 254350,
      "end_ms": 255575,
      "text": "直到好多年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00089",
      "start_ms": 255980,
      "end_ms": 257905,
      "text": "李白还是咽不下这口气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00090",
      "start_ms": 258420,
      "end_ms": 262140,
      "text": "又补写了名句来回敬一座楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00091",
      "start_ms": 262260,
      "end_ms": 267020,
      "text": "能让全天下最傲气的天才在同一堵墙上较劲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00092",
      "start_ms": 267300,
      "end_ms": 268055,
      "text": "一千多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00093",
      "start_ms": 268700,
      "end_ms": 269645,
      "text": "除了黄鹤楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00094",
      "start_ms": 270030,
      "end_ms": 271815,
      "text": "天底下再找不出第二座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00095",
      "start_ms": 272270,
      "end_ms": 275255,
      "text": "这是什么样的文气与傲气？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00096",
      "start_ms": 275640,
      "end_ms": 276265,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00097",
      "start_ms": 276620,
      "end_ms": 277300,
      "text": "滕王阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00098",
      "start_ms": 277720,
      "end_ms": 280605,
      "text": "江西南昌讲到第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00099",
      "start_ms": 281150,
      "end_ms": 285125,
      "text": "他已经几乎把读书人的才气堆到了顶峰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00100",
      "start_ms": 285680,
      "end_ms": 288150,
      "text": "五十七米高九层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00101",
      "start_ms": 288230,
      "end_ms": 290155,
      "text": "飞檐气派大的很。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00102",
      "start_ms": 290870,
      "end_ms": 292850,
      "text": "微微立在赣江边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00103",
      "start_ms": 293270,
      "end_ms": 294830,
      "text": "公元六百七十五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00104",
      "start_ms": 294890,
      "end_ms": 296450,
      "text": "九月初九重阳节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00105",
      "start_ms": 296850,
      "end_ms": 298490,
      "text": "严都督在阁子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00106",
      "start_ms": 298490,
      "end_ms": 299910,
      "text": "大摆酒席请客。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00107",
      "start_ms": 300270,
      "end_ms": 302370,
      "text": "本来想让自己女婿出风头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00108",
      "start_ms": 302710,
      "end_ms": 306090,
      "text": "二十出头的穷小子王勃路过这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00109",
      "start_ms": 306210,
      "end_ms": 308110,
      "text": "提笔写下了滕王阁序。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00110",
      "start_ms": 308510,
      "end_ms": 310210,
      "text": "落霞与孤鹜齐飞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00111",
      "start_ms": 310690,
      "end_ms": 312550,
      "text": "秋水共长天一色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00112",
      "start_ms": 313030,
      "end_ms": 316310,
      "text": "字字漂亮的吓勃现场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00113",
      "start_ms": 316310,
      "end_ms": 319130,
      "text": "那些当官的和有钱人全看傻了眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00114",
      "start_ms": 319450,
      "end_ms": 321500,
      "text": "可真正让人人心疼的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00115",
      "start_ms": 322040,
      "end_ms": 324540,
      "text": "这藤王阁命运太坎坷了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00116",
      "start_ms": 325000,
      "end_ms": 326100,
      "text": "在战火里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00117",
      "start_ms": 326140,
      "end_ms": 334120,
      "text": "前前后后被烧塌了二十八次后人硬是咬牙重建了二十九次王勃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00118",
      "start_ms": 334160,
      "end_ms": 336400,
      "text": "当年喝酒的那座木头老楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00119",
      "start_ms": 336880,
      "end_ms": 339860,
      "text": "连一粒木头沫子都没能留到今天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00120",
      "start_ms": 340400,
      "end_ms": 343440,
      "text": "可哪怕现实里的楼塌了二十八回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00121",
      "start_ms": 344040,
      "end_ms": 350835,
      "text": "连一有读书人心里那座金碧辉煌的滕王阁永远高高挂在天边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00122",
      "start_ms": 351220,
      "end_ms": 352905,
      "text": "楼塌了二十八次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00123",
      "start_ms": 353460,
      "end_ms": 355875,
      "text": "才华却赢了一千四百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00124",
      "start_ms": 356730,
      "end_ms": 359465,
      "text": "这就是滕王阁不可替代的遗纯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00125",
      "start_ms": 359880,
      "end_ms": 360460,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00126",
      "start_ms": 360700,
      "end_ms": 361340,
      "text": "岳阳楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00127",
      "start_ms": 361640,
      "end_ms": 365240,
      "text": "湖南岳阳为什么是他黄鹤楼？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00128",
      "start_ms": 365240,
      "end_ms": 366515,
      "text": "有无数的好诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00129",
      "start_ms": 367100,
      "end_ms": 368995,
      "text": "滕王阁有绝顶的文章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00130",
      "start_ms": 369460,
      "end_ms": 376275,
      "text": "可只有岳阳楼让一座冰冷的建筑彻底变成了全中国人的精神脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00131",
      "start_ms": 376780,
      "end_ms": 378765,
      "text": "他就立在洞庭湖边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00132",
      "start_ms": 379440,
      "end_ms": 382625,
      "text": "全是木头搭起来的三层楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00133",
      "start_ms": 383300,
      "end_ms": 388205,
      "text": "四根通天大柱顶上像扣了个大将军头盔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00134",
      "start_ms": 388750,
      "end_ms": 391315,
      "text": "从头到尾每使一根铁钉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00135",
      "start_ms": 391720,
      "end_ms": 395675,
      "text": "公元一零四四年滕子京重修岳阳楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00136",
      "start_ms": 396420,
      "end_ms": 399315,
      "text": "给远在河南老家养病的好哥们儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00137",
      "start_ms": 399500,
      "end_ms": 401465,
      "text": "范仲淹寄了一幅画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00138",
      "start_ms": 401920,
      "end_ms": 402260,
      "text": "这时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00139",
      "start_ms": 402260,
      "end_ms": 403700,
      "text": "范仲淹刚革新失败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00140",
      "start_ms": 403700,
      "end_ms": 404680,
      "text": "被朝廷贬了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00141",
      "start_ms": 404680,
      "end_ms": 406210,
      "text": "官一身是病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00142",
      "start_ms": 406350,
      "end_ms": 408210,
      "text": "他这辈子压根就没去过岳阳楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00143",
      "start_ms": 408410,
      "end_ms": 409835,
      "text": "也没踩过一级楼梯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00144",
      "start_ms": 410260,
      "end_ms": 412020,
      "text": "可他把画纸铺在桌上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00145",
      "start_ms": 412720,
      "end_ms": 415140,
      "text": "提笔写下的不是自己的委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00146",
      "start_ms": 415600,
      "end_ms": 417240,
      "text": "不是官场上的窝囊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00147",
      "start_ms": 417640,
      "end_ms": 419440,
      "text": "也不是湖边的美景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00148",
      "start_ms": 420040,
      "end_ms": 422920,
      "text": "而是砸在历史骨缝里的十个大字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00149",
      "start_ms": 423680,
      "end_ms": 425480,
      "text": "先天下之忧而忧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00150",
      "start_ms": 425880,
      "end_ms": 428060,
      "text": "后天下之乐而乐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00151",
      "start_ms": 428720,
      "end_ms": 430880,
      "text": "一座楼打这天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00152",
      "start_ms": 431180,
      "end_ms": 433980,
      "text": "不再只是个看风景的亭台楼阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00153",
      "start_ms": 434580,
      "end_ms": 439140,
      "text": "他成了中国读书人一辈子做人做事的最高标尺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00154",
      "start_ms": 439560,
      "end_ms": 442330,
      "text": "别的楼楼比的是词句有多漂亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00155",
      "start_ms": 442870,
      "end_ms": 444310,
      "text": "花样有多好看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00156",
      "start_ms": 444970,
      "end_ms": 448790,
      "text": "而岳阳楼比的是文人胸怀天下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00157",
      "start_ms": 448930,
      "end_ms": 451730,
      "text": "苍生的骨头到底有多硬？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00158",
      "start_ms": 452110,
      "end_ms": 454910,
      "text": "十座名楼讲完了太秀楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00159",
      "start_ms": 454990,
      "end_ms": 456690,
      "text": "点亮了贵州的文脉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00160",
      "start_ms": 457250,
      "end_ms": 460110,
      "text": "望江楼藏着才女的烈泪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00161",
      "start_ms": 460590,
      "end_ms": 463090,
      "text": "太白楼倒满了诗仙的烈酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00162",
      "start_ms": 463450,
      "end_ms": 465970,
      "text": "太观楼看透了百年的历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00163",
      "start_ms": 466470,
      "end_ms": 468130,
      "text": "鹳雀楼二十个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00164",
      "start_ms": 468210,
      "end_ms": 470480,
      "text": "穿透黄河天金阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00165",
      "start_ms": 470480,
      "end_ms": 473900,
      "text": "在大火焦土里立起硬骨头蓬莱阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00166",
      "start_ms": 473900,
      "end_ms": 475815,
      "text": "把人间心事丢给了大海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00167",
      "start_ms": 476320,
      "end_ms": 480560,
      "text": "黄鹤楼让千百个文豪把笔较劲滕王阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00168",
      "start_ms": 480560,
      "end_ms": 481940,
      "text": "哪怕踏了二十八回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00169",
      "start_ms": 482040,
      "end_ms": 485375,
      "text": "依然才气无双可唯独岳阳楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00170",
      "start_ms": 485830,
      "end_ms": 486690,
      "text": "写他的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00171",
      "start_ms": 486810,
      "end_ms": 488805,
      "text": "一辈子没踏进一步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00172",
      "start_ms": 489290,
      "end_ms": 494395,
      "text": "却用一肚子的胸襟重新立起了读书人的灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00173",
      "start_ms": 495020,
      "end_ms": 497495,
      "text": "您说什么叫真正的文人气？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00174",
      "start_ms": 497930,
      "end_ms": 501910,
      "text": "最顶级的文人气从来不是楼修的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00175",
      "start_ms": 501910,
      "end_ms": 503175,
      "text": "有多高有多大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00176",
      "start_ms": 503630,
      "end_ms": 506005,
      "text": "也不是词句堆的有多华丽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00177",
      "start_ms": 506610,
      "end_ms": 509305,
      "text": "而是即便自己被踩在泥坑里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00178",
      "start_ms": 509790,
      "end_ms": 514485,
      "text": "心里头想的依然是天下老百姓能不能过上好日子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00179",
      "start_ms": 514940,
      "end_ms": 515925,
      "text": "最后问您一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00180",
      "start_ms": 516660,
      "end_ms": 519825,
      "text": "这十座名楼您去过哪几座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00181",
      "start_ms": 520360,
      "end_ms": 523725,
      "text": "您心里最有文人气的是哪一座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00182",
      "start_ms": 524300,
      "end_ms": 527265,
      "text": "想听更多名胜古迹背后的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00183",
      "start_ms": 527660,
      "end_ms": 528485,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_02cae841d1a72b7c_s00184",
      "start_ms": 528790,
      "end_ms": 530335,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
